$DATUM 5,5'-(4,5-dimethoxy-1,2-phenylene)bis(2,4-dibromothiophene) (S2) To the
mixture of compound S1 (6.70 g, 20.3 mmol), CHCl3 (100 mL), and AcOH (100
mL) was added NBS (14.79 g, 83.1 mmol) in portions. After being stirred
at room temperature for 6 h, the mixture was diluted with CHCl3. The
organic layer was washed with water (50 mL) and brine (50 mL), dried over
MgSO4, and evaporated under reduced pressure. The crude mixture was
subjected to column chromatography (ethyl acetate:hexane = 1:15) and then
recrystalliszed from ethanol. Yield: 10.7 g (86%) of white solid. m.p.
164 °C. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ: 6.98 (s, 2H), 6.93 (s, 2H), 3.92 (s,
6H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ: 149.37, 138.30, 132.43, 124.66, 114.37,
112.98, 110.10, 56.24. HR-MS (ESI): calcd for C16H10 79Br2 81Br2O2S2
[M+H]+, 640.6713; found, 640.6706.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
